OL,4,BArsenal and PSG keen on Nusa -         
OL,5,BTuesday's gossip                       
OL,6,GArsenal and PSG are both looking at a  
OL,7,Gmove for RB Leipzig winger Antonio     
OL,8,GNusa, Xabi Alonso has Chelsea          
OL,9,Ghierarchy backing and Liverpool open   
OL,10,Gcontract talks with keeper Alisson     
OL,11,GBecker.                                
OL,13,FArsenal have spoken to representatives 
OL,14,Fof Norway winger Antonio Nusa with RB  
OL,15,FLeipzig looking for 80m euros (#67m)   
OL,16,Ffor the 21-year-old. (Teamtalk)        
